data: {"id": "c331195979324627-thinking-parallel_evidence-863", "run_id": "c331195979324627", "node": "parallel_evidence", "node_name": "parallel_evidence", "thinking_type": "ai_message", "tool_name": null, "content": "## 证据结论\n\n### 已确认事实（全部指向 ImagePullBackOff 持续存在）\n\n1. **Pod 状态**：`phase=Pending`，`containersNotReady`，容器 `app` 处于 `Waiting` 状态，`reason=ImagePullBackOff`，`restarts=0`。\n2. **Prometheus Metrics**（已预采集）：`kube_pod_container_status_waiting_reason=1`（reason=ImagePullBackOff），`kube_pod_status_phase` 为 Pending，`restarts=0`。与 kubectl describe 完全一致。\n3. **Kubernetes Events**（关键证据）：\n   - **根因事件**：`Failed to pull image \"registry.cn-hangzhou.aliyuncs.com/google_containers/pause:aiops-fixture-unavailable-20260908\"", "status": null, "result_preview": null, "duration_seconds": null, "iteration": 2, "ts_ms": 1789444585980, "lane_stage": "evidence"}

event: node_complete
data: {"id": "c331195979324627-node_complete-parallel_evidence", "run_id": "c331195979324627", "seq": 864, "ts_ms": 1789444594279, "node": "parallel_evidence", "node_name": "并发证据采集", "duration_seconds": 44.49, "state_snapshot": {"contract_version": "aiops.parallel-evidence-output.v2", "group_count": 1, "expected_group_count": 1, "terminal_group_count": 1, "join_complete": true, "diagnosed_count": 1, "inconclusive_count": 0, "error_count": 0, "errors": [], "groups": [{"group_id": "g1", "presentation_index": 0, "entities": [{"kind": "Pod", "namespace": "aiops-case-v07", "name": "workload"}], "diagnostic_status": "diagnosed", "artifact_ref": {"path": "/tmp/aiops/reports/context_archives/c331195979324627-g1/lane_artifacts/g1/artifact.json", "sha256": "887fb9664a5daa5b9be0fbea8204c78ceed52e65c152a49d8e5f8680ef5569c5", "bytes": 2420}, "snapshot_sha256": "bfb1e12b768d03c27b7d6890c6fc75c3514eb000372efec141d042b7c362f866"}]}, "handoff_summary": ""}

event: node_start
data: {"id": "c331195979324627-node_start-conclusion", "run_id": "c331195979324627", "seq": 865, "ts_ms": 1789444594280, "node": "conclusion", "node_name": "汇总总结"}

event: node_complete
data: {"id": "c331195979324627-node_complete-conclusion", "run_id": "c331195979324627", "seq": 866, "ts_ms": 1789444602498, "node": "conclusion", "node_name": "汇总总结", "duration_seconds": 8.219, "state_snapshot": {"conclusion_length": 1497, "has_errors": false, "has_warnings": false, "conclusion": "## 📊 异常概览与现象\n\n| 组 | 异常实体 | 异常状态 | 关键错误信息 |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| g1 | `aiops-case-v07/workload` | ImagePullBackOff | Pod workload (aiops-case-v07) 处于 ImagePullBackOff 状态，容器无法启动。 |\n\n---\n\n## 🕵️ 证据内容 · g1\n\n| # | 类型 | 来源 | 真实原始结果 | 诊断作用 |\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 1 | K8s State | Kubernetes | `container.waiting_reason`: \"ImagePullBackOff\" (容器: app) | 确认 Pod 当前卡在镜像拉取失败状态 |\n| 2 | K8s Event | Kubernetes | `Failed` 事件: \"rpc error: code = NotFound desc = failed to pull and unpack image ...: not found\" | 明确故障机制：远程仓库返回 NotFound 错误 |\n| 3 | K8s Config | Kubernetes | `image`: \"registry.cn-hangzhou.aliyuncs.com/google_containers/pause:aiops-fixture-unavailable-20260908\" | 锚定引发故障的确切镜像及不存在的标签 |\n| 4 | Metric | Prometheus | `kube_pod_container_status_waiting_reason{reason=\"ImagePullBackOff\"}`: 1 | 验证 K8s 状态指标与 Event 现象一致 |\n| 5 | K8s State | Kubernetes | `pod.status`: \"Pending\", `restart_count`: 0 | 确认 Pod 始终无法启动且未发生过重启 |\n\n证据 2 与 3 结合指出了明确的失败原因：Kubelet 尝试拉取配置中指定的特定镜像标签时，仓库直接报错 `NotFound`。证据 4 和 1 从指标层面佐证了这一 K8s 内部状态，确认了故障的持续性。\n\n## 🎯 根因分析 · g1\n\n```text\n镜像标签 'aiops-fixture-unavailable-20260908' 在仓库中不存在 → Kubelet 拉取镜像返回 NotFound 错误 → K8s 持续尝试拉取失败并进入 Back-off 状态 → Pod 处于 ImagePullBackOff 且 Pending\n```\n\n### 根因结论\n\n**已确认根因**：Pod `aiops-case-v07/workload` 配置中引用的容器镜像标签 `registry.cn-hangzhou.aliyuncs.com/google_containers/pause:aiops-fixture-unavailable-20260908` 在远程镜像仓库中不存在（对应事实 3、证据 2）。\n\n该根因直接导致了 Kubelet 拉取失败，进而使 Pod 状态持续处于 `ImagePullBackOff` 和 `Pending`，用户可见现象为容器无法正常启动且处于 Back-off 退避阶段（对应事实 1、证据 1、4、5）。", "conclusion_formatted": "## 📊 异常概览与现象\n\n| 组 | 异常实体 | 异常状态 | 关键错误信息 |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| g1 | `aiops-case-v07/workload` | ImagePullBackOff | Pod workload (aiops-case-v07) 处于 ImagePullBackOff 状态，容器无法启动。 |\n\n---\n\n## 🕵️ 证据内容 · g1\n\n| # | 类型 | 来源 | 真实原始结果 | 诊断作用 |\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 1 | K8s State | Kubernetes | `container.waiting_reason`: \"ImagePullBackOff\" (容器: app) | 确认 Pod 当前卡在镜像拉取失败状态 |\n| 2 | K8s Event | Kubernetes | `Failed` 事件: \"rpc error: code = NotFound desc = failed to pull and unpack image ...: not found\" | 明确故障机制：远程仓库返回 NotFound 错误 |\n| 3 | K8s Config | Kubernetes | `image`: \"registry.cn-hangzhou.aliyuncs.com/google_containers/pause:aiops-fixture-unavailable-20260908\" | 锚定引发故障的确切镜像及不存在的标签 |\n| 4 | Metric | Prometheus | `kube_pod_container_status_waiting_reason{reason=\"ImagePullBackOff\"}`: 1 | 验证 K8s 状态指标与 Event 现象一致 |\n| 5 | K8s State | Kubernetes | `pod.status`: \"Pending\", `restart_count`: 0 | 确认 Pod 始终无法启动且未发生过重启 |\n\n证据 2 与 3 结合指出了明确的失败原因：Kubelet 尝试拉取配置中指定的特定镜像标签时，仓库直接报错 `NotFound`。证据 4 和 1 从指标层面佐证了这一 K8s 内部状态，确认了故障的持续性。\n\n## 🎯 根因分析 · g1\n\n```text\n镜像标签 'aiops-fixture-unavailable-20260908' 在仓库中不存在 → Kubelet 拉取镜像返回 NotFound 错误 → K8s 持续尝试拉取失败并进入 Back-off 状态 → Pod 处于 ImagePullBackOff 且 Pending\n```\n\n### 根因结论\n\n**已确认根因**：Pod `aiops-case-v07/workload` 配置中引用的容器镜像标签 `registry.cn-hangzhou.aliyuncs.com/google_containers/pause:aiops-fixture-unavailable-20260908` 在远程镜像仓库中不存在（对应事实 3、证据 2）。\n\n该根因直接导致了 Kubelet 拉取失败，进而使 Pod 状态持续处于 `ImagePullBackOff` 和 `Pending`，用户可见现象为容器无法正常启动且处于 Back-off 退避阶段（对应事实 1、证据 1、4、5）。"}, "handoff_summary": ""}

